</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">added lines: 1280, removed lines: 198, total lines: <span class="m">1082</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="合并多次commit">合并多次commit</h3>
<p>例如要合并 最新的三次提交,将后两个提交合并到第一个：</p>]]></description></item><item><title>Git常用命令</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20190613-git%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2019 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20190613-git%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h3 id="create-a-new-repository-on-the-command-line">create a new repository on the command line</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-sh">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"><span class="line"><span class="cl">git init
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git add README.md
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git commit -m <span class="s2">&#34;first commit&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git remote add origin git@github.com:user/project_name.git
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git push -u origin master</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="push-an-existing-repository-from-the-command-line">push an existing repository from the command line</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-sh">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"><span class="line"><span class="cl">git remote add origin git@github.com:user/project_name.git
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git push -u origin master</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="tag">tag</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 查看</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git tag
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 在某个 commit 打 tag</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git tag tag_name commit_id
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 本地 tag 推到线上</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git push origin tag_name
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 删除本地 tag</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git tag -d tag_name
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 删除本地，然后删除线上tag</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git push origin :refs/tags/tag_name
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 添加tag 并推送到远程</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git tag tag_name -m <span class="s2">&#34;tag_msg&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git push origin tag_name</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="commit">commit</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 统计提交次数</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git log <span class="p">|</span> grep <span class="s2">&#34;^Author: Spaceack&#34;</span><span class="p">|</span>wc -l
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 统计合并次数</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git log <span class="p">|</span> grep <span class="s2">&#34;^Merge&#34;</span> <span class="p">|</span> wc -l
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 修改当前分支最新的一次提交。commit的 hash 不变. 避免有多个commit的情况。</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">git commit --amend</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="revert">revert</h3>
<p><code>git revert -n commit-id</code></p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>